# Licences

This repository is under two licences, because it contains two different kinds
of thing.

## The text: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0

Every `README.md` in this repository, meaning all the prose of the book, is
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0
International Licence.

In plain terms, you may:

- **Share** it, copy it, and redistribute it in any medium or format
- **Adapt** it, remix it, translate it, and build on it

So long as you:

- **Give credit.** Name the original and link back to this repository.
- **Do not sell it.** Non-commercial use only.
- **Share alike.** If you remix or build on it, release your version under this
  same licence.

Full legal text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode
Human-readable summary: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

## The code: MIT

Every `.c` file, `Makefile`, and shell script in this repository is licensed
under the MIT Licence, which is as permissive as licences get. Use it in
anything, including commercial work. See `LICENSE-CODE` for the full text.

The split is deliberate. The teaching is mine and I would like it to stay free.
The code is yours to take anywhere.
